# Evaluation outputs: regenerated by eval/run_eval.py and
# eval/run_narrative_eval.py on every run, so they are measurements, not source.
# NOT ignored, because the numbers mean nothing without them:
#   eval/datasets/*        the frozen dev/test sets (test.sha256 pins them)
#   eval/results/*.json    the frozen baselines compared against
#   eval/labels/real_queries_*  the hand-reviewed labels
backend/eval/results/runs/
backend/eval/labels/negative_candidates.json
backend/eval/labels/narrative_negative_candidates.json
